# Lifecraft Engine (4/4 Vehicle, Crew 3) naming Thopter. Grizzly Bears (power 2) alone cannot crew it (refused); with Bot1's
# Ornithopter, a Thopter that Engine makes a 1/3, they are power 3 and do. Crewed, the Engine is an artifact creature that is
# also a Thopter ("Vehicle creatures you control are the chosen type", CR 205.1b) but it is "other than this Vehicle": it
# stays 4/4. It then crews Bot1's Smuggler's Copter (Crew 1; a crewed Vehicle is a creature to pay it): the Copter, a
# Vehicle only and with no bonus until then, is a Thopter and 4/4 (3/3 + 1/+1). On turn 5 the Engine is again just a
# Vehicle.

